{"suttaId":"tha-ap196","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7278,7296],"vripara":"17"},"segments":{"tha-ap196:0.3":"Asokapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap196:1.1":"“Tivarāyaṃ [tipurāyaṃ (syā.)] pure ramme, rājuyyānaṃ ahu tadā;","tha-ap196:1.3":"Uyyānapālo tatthāsiṃ, rañño baddhacaro ahaṃ.","tha-ap196:2.1":"“Padumo nāma nāmena, sayambhū sappabho ahu;","tha-ap196:2.3":"Nisinnaṃ [nisinno (ka.)] puṇḍarīkamhi, chāyā na jahi taṃ muniṃ.","tha-ap196:3.1":"“Asokaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā, piṇḍibhāraṃ sudassanaṃ;","tha-ap196:3.3":"Buddhassa abhiropesiṃ, jalajuttamanāmino.","tha-ap196:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap196:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap196:5.1":"“Sattatiṃsamhito kappe, soḷasa araṇañjahā [aruṇañjahā (sī.)];","tha-ap196:5.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap196:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap196:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā asokapūjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap196:8.1":"Asokapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3174,"to":3175,"paras":[{"para":3174,"vripara":"17","refs":["tha-ap196:1"],"lines":["Catutthattherassāpadāne <b>rañño baddhacaro ahan</b>ti rañño paricārako kammakārako ahosinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap196:1"]]},{"para":3175,"vripara":"19","refs":["tha-ap196:3"],"lines":["<b>Jalajuttamanāmino</b>ti jale udake jātaṃ jalajaṃ, kiṃ taṃ padumaṃ, padumena samānanāmattā padumuttarassa bhagavatoti attho.","Uttamapadumanāmassa bhagavatoti vā attho.","Catutthaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap196:3"],["tha-ap196:3"],["tha-ap196:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap196:1.3","rañño baddhacaro ahaṃ",0,0],["tha-ap196:3.3","jalajuttamanāmino",1,0]]},"tika":null}
